WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
A laboratory bench at midnight.

2
00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.710
A phial of red liquid.

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.180
White crystals on a glass saucer.

4
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.240
A notebook full of dates.

5
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.810
The crystals go in.

6
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:14.080
The mixture fizzes, and
changes colour: red,

7
00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.150
then purple, then green.

8
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.750
Three labels drift over the glass.

9
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.860
Science.

10
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:20.870
Sin.

11
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.040
Magic.

12
00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.450
None of them will settle.

13
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.760
So which is it?

14
00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.940
In this mission, you'll
watch two doctors fall out.

15
00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:31.560
One calls the other's work
"unscientific balderdash".

16
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.790
You'll find the Bible hiding in the story,

17
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.440
from "Satan's signature upon a
face" to "the chief of sinners".

18
00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:43.310
And you'll hear Jekyll insist the drug
"was neither diabolical nor divine".

19
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.470
Your mission: decide whether
the potion is science,

20
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.130
sin or magic.
